                d="M40 384h152v-288h-160v280c0 4.25 3.75 8 8 8zM384 376v-280h-160v288h152c4.25 0 8-3.75 8-8zM416 72v304c0 22-18 40-40 40h-336c-22 0-40-18-40-40v-304c0-22 18-40 40-40h336c22 0 40 18 40 40z"></path>
